      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "As investigators continue to report new realignment operations, controversy persists regarding the selection of procedures for patients with intractable patellar pain. This report summarizes an approach to the patella involving well-documented operations used in individualized combinations tailored to each patient. The outline of the decision-making process is reviewed."},
